  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> be the set of all values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>, for which the shortest distance between the lines&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>0</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>13</mn></math>. Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;",
